> My lawful dwarven valkyrie killed two peacefuls and when she
> re-wielded Excalibur she was blasted by its power yet remains
> lawful in alignment.  Never knew that intelligent artifacts
> also checked one's piety in addition to one's alignment.

Intelligent artifacts blast if you have non-negative alignment.
This is generally not a problem; by the time you get the
artifact, you're alignment is high enough that you can afford to
lose a little without worry.  But it's far from guaranteed.
Especially Excalibur, which as a lawful Valkyrie, you generally
get fairly early.  (I learned this when I ran into some peaceful
gremlins in Juiblex' swamp.  The entire level was soon so full I
had no place to move; I must have killed at least a hundred
before I gave up, and used a scroll of genocide.)

